# CLI Tool Scenario Rules

- Entry point in `cmd/<tool>/main.go` (Go) or `src/main.rs` (Rust)
- Library code in `pkg/` (Go) or `src/lib.rs` (Rust)
- Progress output to stderr, data output to stdout (Unix pipeline philosophy)
- Support `--json` flag for machine-readable output
- Auto-completion scripts in `completions/` directory
- Man page or `--help` output documents all flags and subcommands
- Tests cover: happy path, error paths, edge cases, and output format